# Netlify-style rewrite rules (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages and compatible hosts).
# Prerendered public pages (dist/<path>.html, Home = dist/index.html) and every real file are served
# as they are. App routes that have no prerendered file (account, cart, checkout, search, admin,
# pages published after the last build) get the SPA shell (dist/404.html, a copy of index.html)
# with status 200; any other URL gets the same shell with a real 404 status, so made-up URLs are
# not reported as pages. Kept in sync with the route table by src/build/hosting.test.ts.
/en                          /404.html   200
/admin                       /404.html   200
/admin/*                     /404.html   200
